SCOPE
=====

The licence covers the work original to this repository:

    launcher/               the launcher
    buildroot-external/     Buildroot external tree, package recipes, board files
    tools/                  on-board helpers
    scripts/, docs/         tooling and documentation

It does NOT relicense the third-party software this project builds. Buildroot,
the Linux kernel, U-Boot, RetroArch and every libretro core are fetched from
their own upstreams at pinned revisions and remain under their own licences.

Patches under buildroot-external/package/ and buildroot-external/board/*/patches/
are modifications to those upstream works and inherit the licence of the file
they modify. The kernel patches in buildroot-external/board/opi-zero3/patches/linux/
are vendored unmodified from the Armbian build framework (GPL-2.0); see the
README.md in that directory for their provenance.

buildroot-external/package/retroarch/retroarch/retro-assets/ contains RetroArch
menu assets (fonts, wallpapers, icons) vendored from the RetroArch assets
repository, under their own licences.


GAME CONTENT
============

No ROMs, BIOS images or other copyrighted game content are distributed here.

The PlayStation core requires a BIOS image (SCPH1001.BIN) which is copyrighted
Sony code. It is deliberately not included; supply your own.
